Close Job — PRD Components
1. Business Problem
Recruiters need a clear and reliable way to stop accepting new applications for a job when they no longer want to receive candidates
2. Feature
Close Job
3. Actor
Recruiter
4. Business Rules
*Only an authorized recruiter can close a job
*Existing applications must not be deleted when the job is closed
*Closing a job does not automatically reject or cancel existing applications

The job status must be updated to Closed after successful confirmation
5. Data Model
Application (job Status)=>  closed , CosedAt
6. API Endpoints
Patch/api/jobs/{JobId}/Colse
7. Acceptance Criteria
* Prevent New Applications
Given =>a job is closed
When =>a candidate attempts to submit a new application
Then =>the system rejects the application
And no new application is created
* Existing Applications Are Not Automatically Rejected
Given =>a job has applications before it is closed
When=> the recruiter closes the job
Then =>the system does not automatically reject or cancel those applications
